  "question": {
    "text": "The greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>9</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>9</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>9</mn></mrow></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>I</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
